## Related production checks

`load_fairness_assessment` evaluates the full MVP matrix (F1–F4, I1–I3, A1, etc.) in `datalake_*_fairness_assessment`. The offline FAIR CLI gates **authoring** (F2-01/F2-02) only; lineage-consistency gates **YAML ↔ SQL** at PR time.
